{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id524100802"}, "name":{"label":"sanjid25"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-07-30T15:44:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.15.19"}, "id":{"label":"8928603614"}, "title":{"label":"Minimalist yet sophisticated"}, "content":{"label":"You might think, “Well, what’s the point of a todo app? I can just write down what I gotta do and check it out when I need to!” \n\nQuestion is, how fast can you do this simple thing? Really think about it! No other app has done that job for me as well as Things3.\n\nThings3 has replaced Reminder app for me. I also do not send myself text messages about little details anymore. \n\nIt’s super light and yet makes almost no sacrifice", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id228307587"}, "name":{"label":"tomc1234567891"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2022-05-18T23:53:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.15.17"}, "id":{"label":"8685715477"}, "title":{"label":"Please make more apps…so good"}, "content":{"label":"If someone asked me how to design a good app, I’d tell them to use Things for a month - it’s beautifully functional. Thank you.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id319511125"}, "name":{"label":"53B852"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-10-14T09:01:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.15.4"}, "id":{"label":"7914283227"}, "title":{"label":"On big problem"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app, however unless I am missing something it has a major failing. It does not display my tasks in the time order, i.e. if I have a task due at 8am and a task due at 10am they can appear with the 10am task listed first, for this reason I keep going back to iOS Reminders app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id147498638"}, "name":{"label":"KellR"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-12-18T19:39:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.13.7"}, "id":{"label":"6768901499"}, "title":{"label":"Pleasently Surprised"}, "content":{"label":"Wow!  Things is so well thought out.  So simple and yet so capable.  It just quietly manages \"things\" for you.  Very little effort of input required, but what it gives back is amazing.  The creators have done a stellar job here! \n\niOs 14 widgets are magic too!\n\nI bought this app because of good reviews on YouTube. Yet still wasn't sure I'd actually use it. I am happy to say, Things is steadily growing on me. \n\nI could was lyrical all day about this app.  If you're on the fence, just buy it.  You will thank yourself later.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
