{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id16015723"}, "name":{"label":"tehoro"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-22T20:38:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"1621582776"}, "title":{"label":"Uncomplicated Productivity"}, "content":{"label":"I was a Things use from the very first days of V1, but had drifted away to use other software such as OmniFocus and 2Do, thinking I needed more powerful features.  I didn't really - just added complexity. Things 3 has brought me back, and so far I'm happy I did.  It provides just enough features to do everything I really need, while not being too complicated. Syncing across platforms (iPhone, iPad and Mac) through Things Cloud appears instantaneous. I wish the price was less to upgrade all of those, but I'm willing to pay it to support such great software.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=904237743&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
